WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.478
In a world... where Mars is empty... one team... must bring it to life.

2
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:12.251
Four heroes. One rocket. And nobody... knows the whole plan.

3
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.351
The Captain! Keeper of the cash!

4
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.186
The Vet! Master of the menagerie!

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.629
The Pilot! Commander of rockets!

6
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.231
The Engineer! Fuel. Is. Everything.

7
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:35.502
Your phone is your command console. Only the Vet knows how big that elephant is. So talk... like a planet depends on it.

8
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:41.086
One market. Every team. Wait for the deal... or lose it All.

9
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.361
Three. Two. One. Launch!

10
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.753
Some will land. Some... will not.

11
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:55.509
And every landing brings Mars... back to life.

12
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.686
Elephants on Mars. Gather your crew. The planet is waiting.
